---
{
  "config": {
    "theme": "base",
    "look": "classic",
    "layout": "dagre",
    "maxTextSize": 200000,
    "htmlLabels": false,
    "fontFamily": "Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif",
    "themeVariables": {
      "primaryTextColor": "#1F3340",
      "lineColor": "#64748B",
      "clusterBkg": "#F8FAFC",
      "clusterBorder": "#DDE4ED",
      "edgeLabelBackground": "#FFFFFF",
      "fontSize": "14px"
    },
    "flowchart": {
      "htmlLabels": false,
      "nodeSpacing": 32,
      "rankSpacing": 8,
      "padding": 4,
      "wrappingWidth": 280,
      "minNodeWidth": 180,
      "useMaxWidth": false,
      "curve": "linear"
    }
  }
}
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: 物品交互 · 数据与实体
  accDescr: 物品交互的数据与实体；外部契约保留摘要，可跳转到所属插件。
